  "texts": {
    "preamble": "M/S.Tata Global Beverages Ltd vs Food Safety Officer on 27 August, 2014 Author: B. Kemal Pasha Bench: B.Kemal Pasha In The High Court Of Kerala At Ernakulam Present: The Honourable Mr. Justice B.Kemal Pasha Wednesday, The 14Th Day Of February 2018 / 25Th Magha, 1939 Crl.MC.No. 7902 of 2017 Cc.No.1369/2015 Of Judicial First Class Magistrate Court -I,Aluva -------------- Petitioner/Accused No.3: M/S.Tata Global Beverages Ltd. Pullivasal Packing Centre, Munnar P.O., Kerala-685 612, (Manufacturer). By Sri.P.Vijaya Bhanu,Senior Advocate Advs.Sri.M.Revikrishnan Smt.Mitha Sudhindran Smt.M.P.Shilpa Smt.A.Reshma Sri.K.Sujith Mohan Sri.Vinodkumar Chambalon Sri.P.Ppranil Sri.Shabana Mariyam Sri.Shanavas Nalakath Randupurayil Respondent(S)/Complainant & State: 1. Food Safety Officer, Aluva Circle,Aluva-683 101. 2. State Of Kerala, M/S.Tata Global Beverages Ltd vs Food Safety Officer on 27 August, 2014 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/159818291/ 1 Represented By Public Prosecutor, High Court Of Kerala, Ernakulam-682 031. By Public Prosecutor Sri.C.S.Hrithwik This Criminal Misc. Case Having Been Finally Heard On 14-02-2018, The Court On The Same Day Passed The Following: sts Crl.MC.No. 7902 of 2017 () Appendix Petitioner(S)' Annexures: Annexure A True Copy Of The Complaint Preferred By The 1St Respondent Herein Before The Court Of The Judicial Magistrate Of The First Class-I, Aluva. Annexure B True Copy Of The Form B Report No.14/2014-2015 Dated 27-08-2014 Issued By The Food Analyst. Annexure C True Copy Of The Report Of The Central Food Laboratory, Kolkatta On Examination Of One Part Of The Sample Collected In The Instant Case Dated 08-01-2015. Annexure D True Copy Of The Order Dated 02-11-2017 Passed By The Food Safety And Standards Authority Of India In The Matter Of Iron Filings In Tea. Annexure E True Copy Of The Order Dated 19-05-2016 Passed By The Food Safety And Standards Authority Of India . Respondent'S Annexures: Nil /True Copy/ P.A.To Judge M/S.Tata Global Beverages Ltd vs Food Safety Officer on 27 August, 2014 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/159818291/ 2 sts B. Kemal Pasha, J. ----------------------------------------------- Crl.M.C.No.7902 of 2017 ----------------------------------------------- Dated this the 14th day of February, 2018 Order",
    "facts": "This is a case relating to the limit of iron filling as per order dated 02.11.2017 of the Director (RCD). All States and Union Territories are directed not to launch prosecutions for non-conformance of limit of iron fillings in cases where samples were picked up/tested prior to 19.05.2016. In this case, sample was drawn on 13.08.2014 and prosecution has been launched for non-conformance of iron fillings.",
